title: "Industrial Agentic Intelligence Framework"
abstract: >
  An open-source, UNS-native, cybersecurity-aware multi-agent reference architecture
  for closing the operational knowledge gap in U.S. small-to-mid manufacturers.
  Aligns to ISA-95, MQTT Sparkplug B, OPC UA, NIST SP 800-82, NIST AI RMF, and CMMC L2.
